==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Berserkory is this stage's only threat. Bring a decent anti-Red such as [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]] or an anti-Wave unit to deal with Berserkory.

